    <h2 id="overview">
      What Is Liquid Co-Invest?
    </h2>

    <p>
      Liquid Co-Invest is an AI-assisted trading and market-research service
      associated with the Liquid trading platform. Instead of requiring the
      user to conduct every research step inside a conventional trading
      interface, Co-Invest connects a Liquid account with supported AI
      environments such as Claude and ChatGPT.
    </p>

    <p>
      The basic idea is straightforward: a user can ask an AI assistant about
      a market, review available market information, examine portfolio
      context, and then move from research toward a proposed trade without
      manually switching between several applications.
    </p>

    <p>
      According to Liquid's documentation, Co-Invest is implemented through
      the Model Context Protocol (MCP). The connection can expose market,
      portfolio, and trading capabilities to a compatible AI client while
      retaining explicit confirmation for trading actions in the standard
      Co-Invest workflow.
    </p>

    <div class="callout">

      <strong>CoinvestAI's perspective:</strong>
      The important distinction is that Co-Invest is not simply another
      chatbot. Its value comes from connecting conversational AI with
      trading-related data and account functionality. That can make research
      faster, but it also means users should treat the AI as a tool within
      a trading workflow rather than as an autonomous source of financial truth.

    </div>


