        simulated funds against live market conditions.
      </p>

    </details>


    <details>

      <summary>
        Is Co-Invest suitable for beginners?
      </summary>

      <p>
        Beginners can use the research and educational aspects, but live
        leveraged trading requires significantly more caution. A new user
        should understand margin, liquidation, position sizing and order
        mechanics before using real capital.
      </p>

    </details>


    <details>

      <summary>
        Does using AI guarantee better trading results?
      </summary>

      <p>
        No. AI can accelerate research and help organize information, but it
        cannot guarantee profitable trades. Market outcomes remain uncertain
        and users are responsible for the decisions they make.
      </p>

